    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d104">

                <pb facs="0259" n="167" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg167"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72Su/33</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Diplomatic Liaison Officer with the Supreme War
                        Council</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Frazier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-18T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 18, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.30 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. At the close of the conference on the 16th instant the British and Italian
                    Prime Ministers, accompanied by Mr. Balfour and <pb facs="0260" n="168" xml:id="pg168"/>
                    Signor Bissolati,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d104-f1"/> adjourned
                    to the Foreign Office where they were met by the Italian Ambassador in London.
                    At this conference article 15 of the secret treaty between Great Britain and
                    Italy was discussed, I was informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frazier</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d104-f1" n="1" xml:id="d104-f1-content">
                <p>Italian diplomatic representative on the Supreme War Council.</p>
